WEBVTT

00:03:56.538 --> 00:04:00.538
and these decisions are more biased
by unconscious factors than we think,

00:04:00.579 --> 00:04:02.996
affecting everything
from health and education

00:04:03.038 --> 00:04:05.288
to finance and criminal justice.

00:04:05.413 --> 00:04:08.496
We can't just shut off
our brain's heuristics,

00:04:08.538 --> 00:04:11.746
but we can learn to be aware of them.

00:04:11.788 --> 00:04:15.079
When you come
to a situation involving numbers,

00:04:15.121 --> 00:04:17.663
probability, or multiple details,

00:04:17.704 --> 00:04:18.829
pause for a second

00:04:18.871 --> 00:04:22.954
and consider that the intuitive answer
might not be the right one after all.